# Everything lint-staged cannot see at commit time.
#
# The pre-commit hook lints the files you staged. This runs the checks that only
# make sense against the whole tree: the renderer typecheck, the main process
# typecheck (which nothing else covers -- tsconfig.app.json excludes
# src/electron), and the tests.
#
# Around 12s on a warm cache, and it stops at the first failure.
# `git push --no-verify` skips it.
pnpm verify
